    <CONTROLLED_VOCABULARY CV_ID="Binary">
        <DESCRIPTION LANG_REF="eng">This CV is used for features that have only 2 values, optionally with the addition of a third 'NA' value.
Current features are
- Spreading (True = spread; False = unspread; NA)
- Aperture (True = open; False = closed; NA)
- Repeated movement (True; False)
- Alternating movement (True; False)</DESCRIPTION>
